#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use <guilabel>KrossWordPuzzle</guilabel> to play crosswords or to "
"create new crosswords. It can open and save *.puz-files (AcrossLite) and it's "
"own *.kwp files (which are &XML; files) or *.kwpz (which are compressed *.kwp "
"files). You can download lots of crosswords from within the game."
msgstr ""

